{"id":2979,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年4月28日下午，中北大学纪念五四运动107周年表彰暨2026年学风建设动员大会在科艺苑报告厅隆重举行。信息与通信工程学院师生在此次表彰中表现亮眼，斩获多项重磅荣誉，用实际行动诠释了新时代信通青年的责任与担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LlCBaU8MknN-iMG4GiM7LDozGsMNVf7Ll-iMznVn7liUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4nSyDoSysnRNYM49bnR78UzWVLzUiL4VRn7V2nRnfM7MFUmWVUzN4LlWFL4N8nRCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D3E697D92789D14A2E14531CDAFD4A4C/B2EA931B/394D6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LlCBaU8MknN-iMG4GiM7LDozGsMNVf7Ll-iMznVn7liUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4nSyDoSysnRNYM49bnR78UzWVLzUiL4VRn7V2nRnfM7MFUmWVUzN4LlWFL4N8nRCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在本次表彰中，信息与通信工程学院团委荣获“五四红旗团委”称号，团委书记闫婷荣获“优秀团务工作者”称号，这是对我院共青团工作的高度肯定；学院22050Z01班荣获“中北奖章”，并作为先进集体代表，在大会上进行优秀事迹分享发言，向全校师生展现了信通学子在学风建设、集体建设与全面发展中的卓越风采；我院23050Z01班荣获“五四红旗团支部”称号，该班级班风正、学风浓，凝心聚力、积极向上，充分发挥基层团支部的引领作用；我院程培栋同学凭借在学业科研、社会实践与学生工作中的突出表现，荣获校长奖章，成为全校青年学子的榜样。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3MR7BsU4nkMRL8LGmf7U87DMml8UlQffMRf2LmCDL4QVLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybMSybUSh7U8n2nzU8o7UanlWkMmQkLlLiL7liLlWVUzWFM49PUl78n7VFMz9PLllJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3959ADCDFE448D0EBB66B1C50E51BEA2/781AA4DA/5811E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3nl-BaU4-YMzGPMGRlDLNrVMz78olUfanlCiMmCaL77DnzN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2okyPLYh2M8nRM49aozAko7V7olCaolLYnRLPLRUPnRTFM7LYLN7aLRAFL4GaU8LZgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4CaoSbw62k8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3UmABkLR-bL46kMGRNbU8QknRUsUz-fsnzARnzNaL4TkUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4LSyZLkyPnmMVL77aUzCanl-8o7r2Mz6kUmWVL4VVMR6FLRr2UzWfozQFL47ZnmlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/331801F3E0A0A60EB48EF57BB2E31E47/05FA2A96/318F5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3UmABkLR-bL46kMGRNbU8QknRUsUz-fsnzARnzNaL4TkUzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4LSyZLkyPnmMVL77aUzCanl-8o7r2Mz6kUmWVL4VVMR6FLRr2UzWfozQFL47ZnmlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\"><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3UlLBsLmf7ozCDnGNLsn7VfnNCaUzWfRnRUZnRGDMNnknmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRUShVMkhkL47aMRUbnz6fLR7DM4Tko7rkUmW7Mz9aMmWFMlCiMRUioRQFLNnRLmGJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1CAE4B310449E7A01679B8EBB2D58062/5F544586/2DC20\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3UlLBsLmf7ozCDnGNLsn7VfnNCaUzWfRnRUZnRGDMNnknmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRUShVMkhkL47aMRUbnz6fLR7DM4Tko7rkUmW7Mz9aMmWFMlCiMRUioRQFLNnRLmGJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次大会，是对我院共青团工作与青年学子成长成果的一次集中检阅。近年来，我院始终坚持以立德树人为根本任务，不断深化思想政治引领，着力打造优良学风与团学品牌活动，为青年成长搭建广阔平台。此次荣誉的获得，是学院全体师生共同努力的结果，更是我院共青团工作高质量发展的生动体现。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3L8UBPL4CPLmvYoGl74n7Uinz7DLmlf8LRGZo7M2L8M7nRG0gihFp2hmCIa0okybMkyYn1y4LR7ZoRAVMz-8n774MmCiUNn2oR62Ll-aoRfFnNWfL7lDLNrFL4-ZU47Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8942F301888E524DA3665BDF87F1B080/FBA0E62E/328C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3L8UBPL4CPLmvYoGl74n7Uinz7DLmlf8LRGZo7M2L8M7nRG0gihFp2hmCIa0okybMkyYn1y4LR7ZoRAVMz-8n774MmCiUNn2oR62Ll-aoRfFnNWfL7lDLNrFL4-ZU47Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg\"></p><p>我院团委将以此次表彰为新的起点，继续在校团委、院党委的领导下，坚持以思想政治引领为核心，聚焦青年学生成长成才目标，不断提升团组织的引领力、组织力、服务力，团结带领全院广大青年传承五四精神，勇担时代使命，为学校和学院的高质量发展贡献青春力量。</p><p>值此五四青年节来临之际，祝愿全体信通学子节日快乐！愿大家以青春之我、奋斗之我，在新征程上勇毅前行，书写属于新时代青年的华彩篇章！</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=3LlCBaU8MknN-iMG4GiM7LDozGsMNVf7Ll-iMznVn7liUz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4nSyDoSysnRNYM49bnR78UzWVLzUiL4VRn7V2nRnfM7MFUmWVUzN4LlWFL4N8nRCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47sMmGbgtA8pUkcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17609&e=.jpg"}